# Infrastructure review report

Copy to the pull request or change record and fill every section. Write
"not applicable" rather than deleting a section.

## Summary

- Change: <pull request or change ID>
- Decision: accept | accept with conditions | reject
- Reviewer: <name>  Date: <YYYY-MM-DD>
- Operator for apply/deploy: <name>  Target: <account/subscription, backend or scope>

## Scope

| Item | Value |
| --- | --- |
| Environments | |
| State backends / workspaces / stacks | |
| Pipeline identities (plan, apply) | |
| Data-bearing resources in scope | |
| Untrusted triggers possible | yes / no |

